{
  "bodyHash": "mHFpvSQ2tqw=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156128/description_34c2bcd1-b376-4c32-b8d9-9eea2990be78.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"109\"></h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Sodium 已更新并移除了本模组所挂钩的接口。鉴于我对维护此模组的兴趣本就不高，且本计划在 Minecraft 转向 Vulkan 时将其存档，我决定现在停止开发。感谢大家的支持！任何希望让模组继续运行的人都可以自由创建分支 :)</strong></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组是 kirillirik 开发的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbedrodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bedrodium</a> 的一个分支</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pC8HxhTPK3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/vesmaybevesper/substrate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fvesmaybevesper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsubstrate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/zNuzb72d?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;color=276538\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"></a><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1156128?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"28\"></p><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156128/description_8dff9f9c-b32a-47a7-80b7-bfbe119a01bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"33\"></h2><p><em><strong>需要安装 Sodium</strong></em>。</p><p>通过移除世界底部/顶部不可见侧面的方式实现小型优化。对于玩家而言，这些侧面仅在必要时才可见。（主世界底部的多边形层将被删除，下界中底部和顶部的多边形层都会删除）。虽然模组以基岩为主题，但它实际上并不检查方块类型，即使在浮空岛屿世界（如小游戏服务器！）中也能带来性能提升。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3146\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9280455e1c94978a408dde3d6785bce2a4503d_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"300\"></a></p>",
